<view class="screen">
  <view class="title">学校归属与校内 UID 管理</view>
  <view class="notice">仅超级管理员可更正当前已验证的学校归属，或明确补发符合条件的校内 UID。</view>
  <view aria-role="status">{{status}}</view><view wx:if="{{addressError || error}}" class="error" aria-role="alert">{{addressError || error}}</view><view wx:if="{{receiptStatus}}" class="notice">{{receiptStatus}}</view>
  <button bindtap="onReload" disabled="{{busy}}">重新核验当前状态与原请求</button><button wx:if="{{busy}}" bindtap="onStopWaiting">停止等待</button>
  <view wx:if="{{!frozen}}" class="card"><input class="input" value="{{targetProfileId}}" placeholder="已知公开主页 ID" maxlength="36" bindinput="onTargetInput" disabled="{{busy}}" /><button bindtap="onReload" disabled="{{busy || !targetProfileId}}">核验此公开主页</button></view>
  <view wx:if="{{management &amp;&amp; !frozen}}" class="card">
    <view>{{management.target.displayName}}</view><view>当前认证学校：{{management.current.school ? management.current.school.name : '不可确认'}}</view>
    <view wx:if="{{management.current.schoolUid.status === 'assigned'}}">当前校内 UID：{{management.current.schoolUid.formattedUid}}</view><view wx:else>校内 UID {{management.current.schoolUid.status === 'unassigned' ? '尚未分配' : '暂不可用'}}</view>
    <view wx:if="{{management.actions.correctSchool}}">
      <input class="input" value="{{campusQuery}}" placeholder="搜索目标学校或校区" bindinput="onCampusQuery" disabled="{{busy}}" /><button bindtap="onSearchCampuses" disabled="{{busy}}">搜索目标校区</button>
      <button wx:for="{{campuses}}" wx:key="id" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="onSelectCampus" disabled="{{busy}}">{{item.institutionName}} · {{item.fullName}}</button>
      <button wx:if="{{campusPage > 1}}" bindtap="onPreviousCampuses" disabled="{{busy}}">上一页</button><button wx:if="{{campusPage * 20 &lt; campusTotal}}" bindtap="onNextCampuses" disabled="{{busy}}">下一页</button>
      <view wx:if="{{management.destination}}">目标学校：{{management.destination.school.name}} · {{management.destination.campusName}}</view>
      <button wx:if="{{management.destination}}" data-action="correct_school" bindtap="onRequest" disabled="{{busy}}">预览并确认学校更正</button>
    </view>
    <button wx:if="{{management.actions.completeUid}}" data-action="complete_uid" bindtap="onRequest" disabled="{{busy}}">补发当前学校的 UID</button>
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{confirming &amp;&amp; confirming !== 'cancel' &amp;&amp; management &amp;&amp; !frozen}}" class="card" aria-role="alert">
    <view>确认{{confirming === 'complete_uid' ? '补发当前学校 UID' : '学校归属更正'}}？</view><view>对象：{{management.target.displayName}}</view>
    <view>当前学校：{{management.current.school.name}}</view><view wx:if="{{confirming === 'correct_school'}}">目标学校：{{management.destination.school.name}}</view>
    <view wx:if="{{confirming === 'correct_school' &amp;&amp; management.current.school.code === management.destination.school.code}}" class="notice">这是同一学校，将确认无需变更，不重新分配 UID。</view>
    <view wx:elif="{{confirming === 'correct_school'}}" class="notice">如有原学校 UID，其号码永久保留在历史中，不能重新使用；目标学校分配新 UID。具体号码以提交结果后的当前查询为准。现有认证有效期不会延长，身份校区需要本人重新明确选择。</view>
    <view wx:else class="notice">仅补发当前学校 UID，现有审核结果与学校归属不变。已有有效号码不会重复分配。</view>
    <button bindtap="onSubmit" disabled="{{busy}}">确认提交此操作</button><button bindtap="onClose" disabled="{{busy}}">返回</button>
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{frozen}}" class="card">
    <view>原{{pendingAction === 'correct_school' ? '学校更正' : 'UID 补发'}}请求待确认 · {{pendingPhase === 'cancel' ? '取消中' : '提交中'}}</view>
    <view class="notice">查询不到回执不代表失败。停止等待、返回或关闭页面都不会取消服务端请求；新会话仍由原账号恢复同一请求。</view>
    <button bindtap="onRecover" disabled="{{busy || !pendingRequestId}}">查询原请求回执</button><button bindtap="onRetry" disabled="{{busy || !pendingRequestId}}">查询并重试原请求</button><button bindtap="onCancelRequest" disabled="{{busy || !pendingRequestId}}">取消原请求</button>
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{confirming === 'cancel'}}" class="card" aria-role="alert"><view>确认取消尚未完成的原请求？如果已完成，将返回原结果，不回滚更正或 UID。</view><button bindtap="onConfirmCancel" disabled="{{busy}}">确认取消原请求</button><button bindtap="onClose" disabled="{{busy}}">返回</button></view>
  <navigator class="link" url="/pages/school-uid-lookup/school-uid-lookup">按学校与 UID 查询 →</navigator>
</view>
